{"3301370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Comatose", "steam_appid": 3301370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4502880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a spiral, Laura must carve her way through the depths of her unconscious mind or sink into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.poster.avif?t=1787735929\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.webm?t=1787735929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/db14e4e497793fe8fcb5cf2dd35fb258.mp4?t=1787735929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Survival Horror </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find supplies and survive as you navigate a deserted town with monsters that will haunt you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/aa8d89ab00e34118bb2baedceeb7e368.poster.avif?t=1787735929\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/aa8d89ab00e34118bb2baedceeb7e368.webm?t=1787735929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301370/extras/aa8d89ab00e34118bb2baedceeb7e368.mp4?t=1787735929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will change as you progress, becoming more corrupted as you 